    <string name="title_help_instructions">
        Tap on an app icon or name and tick restrictions to apply them.
        If possible, apps are automatically stopped to apply (or remove) restrictions immediately,
        but applying restrictions to some apps requires a device restart (see icons below).
        <![CDATA[<br><br>]]>Long press on an app name or icon to start the app.
        <![CDATA[<br><br>]]>See <![CDATA[<a href="https://github.com/M66B/XPrivacyLua/blob/master/README.md">the documentation</a>]]>
        and <![CDATA[<a href="https://github.com/M66B/XPrivacyLua/blob/master/FAQ.md">the frequently asked questions</a>]]> for more information.
    </string>
